## 4. Execution Instructions

Set the API keys in your environment and start the service:

```bash
export EXA_API_KEY="your-exa-key"
export GENERALCOMPUTE_API_KEY="your-generalcompute-key"
export INSTAVM_API_KEY="your-instavm-key"

pip install fastapi uvicorn exa-py generalcompute instavm beautifulsoup4 pydantic

python app.py
```

Open `` to interact with the discovery agent and run deep verification.
